  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ban 1450.06 Classification by Risk. All collateral enumerated in Ban 1450.04 and Ban 1450.05 shall be identically classified as low risk collateral for public funds on deposit.\n\nSource. #6961, eff 3-25-99, EXPIRED: 3-25-07\n\nNew. #9187, eff 6-24-08, INTERIM, EXPIRED: 12-21-08\n\nNew. #9557, eff 10-3-09; ss by #10997, INTERIM, eff 12-23-15, EXPIRES: 6-20-16; ss by #11113, eff 6-1-16\n\nAPPENDIX",
